== G1 = F o phi1, phi1 = (x, y+x^2, z+y) : radical 1+xy+x^3 ==
det J(G1) = -2 (direct symbolic)
G1(0,0,-1/4) = G1(1,-5/2,9) = G1(-1,1/2,6) = (-1/4, 0, 0); full fiber = exactly these three (Groebner)
== G2 = F o nu (Nagata), D = y^2+xz ==
det J(nu) = 1 (direct); det J(G2) = -2 (chain rule with det J(F) = -2, S323)
nu carries (0,0,-1/4), (-16733/32,-467/8,13/2), (-4197/32,233/8,13/2) onto F's original preimages;
G2 of all three = (-1/4, 0, 0); triples distinct.
